# path|token|evidence (evidence is mandatory and is what a reviewer reads)

# ── host-allowlist ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# rustdoc intra-doc links to this crate's own published API docs — a
# doc-comment citation, never a runtime fetch (core makes no network calls).
beebeeb-types/src/file.rs|docs.rs|rustdoc link to beebeeb-core's own API docs in a doc-comment; not a runtime call

# Negative tests: hosts that only look like loopback must be refused for
# plain-HTTP sessions. The client never connects to them.
beebeeb-client/src/tests_svc_auth/session.rs|127.0.0.1.example.com|test input that session validation must reject as non-loopback; never contacted
beebeeb-client/src/tests_svc_auth/session.rs|localhost.example.com|test input that session validation must reject as non-loopback; never contacted
